## =======================================================================
## .NET / Visual Studio Build & Artifacts
## Ref: https://github.com/omran95/.NET-Clean-Architecture-example/blob/main/.gitignore
## =======================================================================
# Ignore compilation build outputs from all layers (Domain, Application, Infrastructure, WebApi)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
bld/

# Log files
*.log
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

## =======================================================================
## IDE & Editor Specific Files (Visual Studio, VS Code, JetBrains Rider)
## =======================================================================
# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

## =======================================================================
## Package & Dependency Management
## =======================================================================
# NuGet Packages
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
packages/
# Restore artifacts
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

## =======================================================================
## Environment, Secrets & Local Configurations
## =======================================================================
# NEVER commit environment-specific configurations or local app secrets
## While in practice ignoring development settings is good, for the purposes of this exercise I  **/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
*.secrets.json
.env

## =======================================================================
## Local Databases & Persistent Storage
## =======================================================================
# Database files used for local Infrastructure testing (EF Core, SQLite, etc.)
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

## =======================================================================
## Operating System Specific Files
## =======================================================================
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
